<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex, Stalexport and Universal closed lower, one stock closed higher and one was flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday. Five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Total turnover was 2.4 million zlotys, up from Wednesday's 1.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 2.1 percent to 122,5 zlotys in a turnover of 8.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
